    "zh": "宇宙最差救援指南"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Arnold and Ah Qiu share a beat-up spaceship, scraping by on platform-dispatched orders. However, their unreliable and lazy personalities ensure they can just barely make ends meet. Then, one ordinary, cash-strapped day, Arnold received an exorbitantly priced commission…… Cosmic civilizations and various factions will soon be brought together by this single small spaceship, as an adventure story about the clash of different interstellar civilizations and ideals is about to unfold."
  },
